Without --floors the floors are 0, 55, 75, 90, 105, 120 and 150 percent of FTP, rounded half up. These are the floors Garmin stored for FTP 279.
-- args --
profile
power-zones
set
cycling
--ftp
279
-- route PUT /biometric-service/powerZones/all 204 --
